间范围</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>31</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>四、 工作安排</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（一）测评安排：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>20</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>（班主任）：设置班级互评；在班级学生都提交自评后导入德育基础分；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>21</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>（学生）：学生自评、互评；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>23</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>4</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>（班主任）：班级评议（班级组织审核）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>5</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>（年级辅导员）：各年级审核学生测评情况，分别导入学生学年平均绩点和体育基础分，得出学生测评总分（提交至学院副书记审批）；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>8</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>10</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>5</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：学院审批、公示结果、无异议提交至学校。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>（二）评优安排：</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><strong>10</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>10</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>12</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学生</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>预申报奖学金，申请学生若属于《办法》中的第十六条，则不得申请；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span><span><span><strong>10</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>1</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>2</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>14</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：年级辅导员审核奖学金申报名单，确定最终拟获奖名单；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><strong>10</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>14</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>-</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>16</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>：学院公示综合测评评优拟获奖名单。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><strong>六、 相关说明</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>1</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span><span><span>智育基础分由本学院从教务系统导出的不含重修课程及第二学位成绩的平均绩点，发给学生核对后，再导入，请确保学号格式准确。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span><span><span>德育基础分由班级综合测评评议小组按要求给全班同学打分并取平均分，请确保学号格式准确。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>3</span></span></span><span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span><span><span>申请先进班级体需提交</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>2000</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>字以上先进事迹材料及</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>张电子版班级活动照。此步骤可在学生申请综合测评奖项时在评优系统上填报。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：谭老师；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系方式：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>020</span></span></span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span><span><span><span>85282190</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>联系地址：水利与土木工程学院</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>215</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>办公室。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>水利与土木工程学院</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p></div>","content_text":"各位同学：\n为鼓励学生勤奋学习、积极进取，德智体美劳全面发展，根据《华南农业大学本科生综合测评及评优实施办法》（华农党发〔\n2020\n〕\n38\n号）（以下简称《办法》），现将\n2025\n-\n2026\n学年本科生综合测评及评优相关工作通知如下。\n一、 测评及评优对象\n我院\n2025\n-\n2026\n学年全日制本科二年级及以上学生。\n2025\n-\n2026\n学年休学学生、留学生不参评。\n二、 测评方式\n本次综合测评采用“综合测评系统”进行线上测评。系统网址\nhttps://xgxt.scau.edu.cn/zhcp\n三、 测评时间范围\n2025\n年\n9\n月\n1\n日\n-\n2026\n年\n8\n月\n31\n日\n四、 工作安排\n（一）测评安排：\n9\n月\n20\n日\n-\n2\n1\n日\n（班主任）：设置班级互评；在班级学生都提交自评后导入德育基础分；\n9\n月\n21\n日\n-\n2\n2\n日\n（学生）：学生自评、互评；\n9\n月\n23\n日\n-\n2\n4\n日\n（班主任）：班级评议（班级组织审核）；\n9\n月\n2\n5\n日\n-\n2\n7\n日\n（年级辅导员）：各年级审核学生测评情况，分别导入学生学年平均绩点和体育基础分，得出学生测评总分（提交至学院副书记审批）；\n9\n月\n2\n8\n日\n-\n10\n月\n5\n日\n：学院审批、公示结果、无异议提交至学校。\n（二）评优安排：\n10\n月\n10\n日\n-\n12\n日\n：\n学生\n预申报奖学金，申请学生若属于《办法》中的第十六条，则不得申请；\n10\n月\n1\n2\n日\n-\n14\n日\n：年级辅导员审核奖学金申报名单，确定最终拟获奖名单；\n10\n月\n14\n日\n-\n16\n日\n：学院公示综合测评评优拟获奖名单。\n六、 相关说明\n1\n.\n智育基础分由本学院从教务系统导出的不含重修课程及第二学位成绩的平均绩点，发给学生核对后，再导入，请确保学号格式准确。\n2\n.\n德育基础分由班级综合测评评议小组按要求给全班同学打分并取平均分，请确保学号格式准确。\n3\n.\n申请先进班级体需提交\n2000\n字以上先进事迹材料及\n6\n-\n8\n张电子版班级活动照。此步骤可在学生申请综合测评奖项时在评优系统上填报。\n联系人：谭老师；\n联系方式：\n020\n-\n85282190\n；\n联系地址：水利与土木工程学院\n215\n办公室。\n水利与土木工程学院\n2026\n年\n9\n月\n16\n日","attachments":[],"status":"ok","crawled_at":"2026-11-08T23:28:14+08:00"}